        {"q":"The teacher (A) / together with his students (B) / were there. (C) / no error (D)","options":["A","B","C","D"],"answer":2,"explanation":"First subject 'teacher' singular. were → was."},
        {"q":"A table in addition (A) / to two chairs are (B) / all that he has. (C) / no error (D)","options":["A","B","C","D"],"answer":1,"explanation":"First subject 'table' singular. are → is."},
