        {"q":"Many a boy (A) / have (B) / left the class. (C) / no error (D)","options":["A","B","C","D"],"answer":1,"explanation":"'Many a' + singular noun → singular verb. have → has."},
        {"q":"This is one of the best novels (A) / that (B) / has been published. (C) / no error (D)","options":["A","B","C","D"],"answer":2,"explanation":"'that' refers to 'novels' (plural). has → have."},
        {"q":"He is (A) / one of the greatest leaders (B) / who has served India. (C) / no error (D)","options":["A","B","C","D"],"answer":2,"explanation":"'who' refers to leaders (plural). has → have."},
        {"q":"She weeps (A) / as though (B) / she is in despair. (C) / no error (D)","options":["A","B","C","D"],"answer":2,"explanation":"'as though' takes unreal past. is → were."},
