        {"q":"This is the only (A) / one of his stories (B) / that are worth reading. (C) / no error (D)","options":["A","B","C","D"],"answer":2,"explanation":"'only one' → singular. are → is."},
        {"q":"Many a criminal (A) / have been (B) / arrested. (C) / no error (D)","options":["A","B","C","D"],"answer":1,"explanation":"'Many a' → singular. have → has."}
