      "rules": [
        "Articles: a/an/the — check countable vs uncountable, first mention vs specific.",
        "Prepositions: look for fixed pairs — accustomed to, capable of, adhere to, deprived of, insist on, prevent from, complain to, apologise for, differ from, prefer to.",
        "Tenses: look for time markers — yesterday, last night, since, for, already, yet.",
        "Parallelism: not only...but also, either...or, neither...nor must join the same grammatical type.",
        "Comparatives: than not then; more not better; as...as not so...as in negative.",
        "Redundancy: return back, discuss about, repeat again, more better, most best — all wrong.",
        "Uncountables: luggage, furniture, information, advice, machinery — no plural -s."
