        {"q":"Wearing extremely fashionable clothes (a) / and surrounded by photographers (b) / and press operators (c) / she swept up the microphone. (d) / No error (e)","options":["a","b","c","d","e"],"answer":3,"explanation":"'swept up' wrong phrasal verb. Should be 'swept' or 'picked up'."},
